From 2ff7453b3a2ccdf2e549bd2cf181cf07f468f2df Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pogo-bash <pogo-bash@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 23:33:49 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] LibWeb: Pointer lock with an embedder hook

requestPointerLock() returns a promise settled by the embedder
(PageClient::page_did_request_pointer_lock, Document::did_lock_pointer),
pointerLockElement on DocumentOrShadowRoot, onpointerlockchange/error,
exitPointerLock(), and mouse events retargeted to the lock element.
---
